<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to refer to the Parliament of the
Commonwealth certain matters relating to State Bank
Limited.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e5b0b18b-edb6-41bf-a0f0-dd2e0948bffb"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading id="sec.1-he"
guid="_8138c9a9-d48c-4a20-98c5-bddc917ba82d"><b>Name of
Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" refid="act-1992-104" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Commonwealth Powers (State Banking) Act
1992</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_79db6d02-a768-47d4-88f0-d67c0397c5d4"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading id="sec.2-he"
guid="_cc8db16f-386d-4cdf-a3c6-622e18a4e83d"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day to be appointed by
proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1030034a-b2c7-49c5-afa5-7f3f9ed446a6"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading id="sec.3-he"
guid="_1b5eb65d-f823-4ea4-8855-e1978c2642fd"><b>Object</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The object of this Act is to remove the
constitutional barrier which prevents the Parliament of the Commonwealth from
legislating with respect to State banking carried on within the limits of the
State by State Bank Limited or a subsidiary of that
company.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_27c94000-9038-455d-a223-830c59e7c632"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading id="sec.4-he"
guid="_16f8bd00-7cce-45af-83f3-3dae611dee3b"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm id="def.Bank"
guid="_e53ccc90-25df-40ed-a759-b90a79b1afc1"
type="definition"><b><i>Bank</i></b></defterm> means State Bank Limited, and
includes a subsidiary of that company (within the meaning of the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="sl-1999-0703" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Corporations Law</i></name></legref>) and also includes that
company under any altered name.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm id="def.Statebanking"
guid="_780e3b12-bf5c-45e9-b32d-4f8635f63970" type="definition"><b><i>State
banking</i></b></defterm> means State banking as referred to in section 51
(xiii) of the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Commonwealth
Constitution</name></legref>.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_71b9dda8-ced8-4630-87c1-f839ff807c3e"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading id="sec.5-he"
guid="_3392d857-d73a-4c2a-980e-df9dd1ba35cd"><b>Reference of matters relating
to the Bank</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The matter of State banking (but only in so far
as it applies in relation to the Bank), to the extent to which it is not
otherwise included in the legislative powers of the Parliament of the
Commonwealth, is referred to the Parliament of the Commonwealth for a period
commencing on the day on which this Act commences and ending on the day fixed,
pursuant to section 7, as the day on which the reference under this Act is to
terminate, but no longer.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8a99e895-086a-49e9-bee8-ce7f85b2c2b8"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading id="sec.6-he"
guid="_b3e46dde-f384-4528-946f-56ce9ad1a5ae"><b>Excluded
matters</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aab88f60-5005-4105-aae4-a9edbe4862a7"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The reference under section 5 does not include
any matter so far as it would confer powers to make provision for or with
respect to all or any of the following matters:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a" guid="_28b860ab-9c37-401b-823b-e38da3d08277"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">prohibiting the Bank (whether specifically or as
part of a provision of more general application) from carrying on banking
business unless it is in possession of an authority (however described) to do
so under a law of the Commonwealth,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b" guid="_8b4e69c9-142b-4331-b877-c9e83b538b02"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">granting, suspending, cancelling or otherwise
dealing with such an authority in relation to the
Bank.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_83e2ba32-04a9-42a5-9c43-d5e346a3a832"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) ceases to have effect on a day to
be appointed by proclamation for the purposes of this
section.</txt></block></tier>

<note id="sec.6-note" guid="_5f542f26-8795-40cd-83bd-0b4a5660aa20"
type="editorial"><heading id="sec.6-note-he"
guid="_b1a7e590-f83d-46ed-8547-f25de2472911"><b>Editorial
note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 6 (1) ceased to have effect on 30 June
1994. See proclamation pursuant to section 6 (2) in Gazette No 83 of
24.6.1994, p 3107.</txt></block></note>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f07d693e-fbea-4b69-9691-4ea137e0893c"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading id="sec.7-he"
guid="_391eb41a-9bbb-405a-abb9-8f4408f27f51"><b>Termination of
reference</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may, at any time, by proclamation
published on the NSW legislation website, fix a day as the day on which the
reference under this Act is to terminate.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Am 2009 No 106,
Sch 3.11.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1c8b1f60-e233-49ec-b5c2-6f2d1c5e23cc"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading id="sec.8-he"
guid="_a4763539-f03d-497b-8dfd-5ff9378ba2dd"><b>Crown
bound</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown.</txt></block></level>
</content>


